-- statement:
--   For a genuine original spectrally negative Lévy process, original right-continuous stopping time and separated negative physical marked rectangles on a deterministic grid bounded by T, the stopped compensated predictable sum is integrable and has exact mean zero. Source cutoff domination automatically establishes every count L² hypothesis and the previously proved stopped predictable-grid theorem supplies masked coefficient L², with no equality-in-law substitutes or extra stochastic axioms.
-- source:
--   Proved original true stopped predictable finite-grid mean-zero 963a2598 and original separated Borel cell centered L² via full band 963870c8. All formal stochastic assumptions are already present in these original sources.

